{"ref":"BDB Aramaic, מֶ֫לֶךְ","hw":"מֶ֫לֶךְ","html":"<big><span dir=\"rtl\">מֶ֫לֶךְ</span></big><sub>178</sub>  <strong>n.m. king (</strong>general Sem.; v. BH<strong>)</strong>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳</span> abs. <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:10\" href=\"/Daniel.2.10\">Dn 2:10</a> + 2 times; cstr. <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:34\" href=\"/Daniel.4.34\">4:34</a> + 6 times; usually emph. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַלְכָּא</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 4:8\" href=\"/Ezra.4.8\">Ezr 4:8</a> + 154 times, <span dir=\"rtl\">ה—ָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:11\" href=\"/Daniel.2.11\">Dn 2:11</a>; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַלְכִין</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 4:15\" href=\"/Ezra.4.15\">Ezr 4:15</a> + 9 times, <span dir=\"rtl\">ים—ִ</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 4:13\" href=\"/Ezra.4.13\">4:13</a> (Hebraism, Be-Ry M<sup>41 *</sup>); emph. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַלְכַיָּא</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:44\" href=\"/Daniel.2.44\">Dn 2:44</a> + 2 times;—<em>king</em> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:4\" href=\"/Daniel.2.4\">Dn 2:4</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:5\" href=\"/Daniel.2.5\">5</a> + 132 times Dn, <a data-ref=\"Ezra 4:8\" href=\"/Ezra.4.8\">Ezr 4:8</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezra 4:11\" href=\"/Ezra.4.11\">11</a> + 42 times Ezr (<span dir=\"rtl\">מֶלֶךְ מַלְכַיָּא</span> of Neb. <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:37\" href=\"/Daniel.2.37\">Dn 2:37</a>, of Artax. <a data-ref=\"Ezra 7:12\" href=\"/Ezra.7.12\">Ezr 7:12</a> [cf. Cooke<sup>71, 3</sup>, of Xerxes]; <span dir=\"rtl\">מַלְכִין</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:17\" href=\"/Daniel.7.17\">Dn 7:17</a> = kingdoms, cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB Aramaic, מַלְכוּ\" href=\"/BDB Aramaic,_מַלְכוּ\", dir=\"rtl\">מַלְכוּ</a> v <a data-ref=\"Ezra 4:23\" href=\"/Ezra.4.23\">23</a>).","next":"BDB Aramaic, מַלְכָּה","prev":"BDB Aramaic, מלך"}